    description: Some("Two-on-two half-court basketball with a play-calling layer: before every possession both sides pick a play — pick-and-roll, give-and-go, or just clear out and drive — then execute it live. Optional referees enforce fouls and the three-second lane. One of Atari\'s very last 2600 releases, from Dolphin\'s programmer."),
